 to  stay low carb  and then another product that i actually  use uh is one of dave free burke's  products called munique okay which is an  m-u-n-i-q  okay it's basically a powder that you  just pour into water and it becomes like  a shake  you can get different flavors like  chocolate shake  and it's it's uh like a prebiotic fiber  and it keeps your  blood sugar more stable throughout the  day and it reduces your appetite oh  interesting so i found that to be  helpful yeah  um  awesome this has been fantastic where uh  where can we send people to find you on  the internet or if there's founders who  want to uh to talk to craft where's yeah  so yeah contact us to craft ventures um  i'm afraid to give my my email  let's put it this way if you know it  should be easy to get to us  uh you know use your skills to find  someone in our network shouldn't be that  hard and you can reach out to craft  ventures awesome we had somebody come on  they gave their email uh and they said  i'll give i'll mail you a free book and  uh suppose there were six thousand  people that emailed them and they spent  the next week trying to get rid of the  email so please don't do that um i hope  that uh that you guys all joined you can  follow david on twitter at david sacks  but uh this was fantastic i really  enjoyed it and we'll definitely do it  again yeah thanks for having me that's  great
 

